35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The time lost to copying is nearly an hour daily.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The coordination group is understaffed. Two people do it all.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Half the customer plants lose network coverage for afternoons.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The capital line is frozen, but software allowance has room.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Tools needing daily entry from everyone were quietly dropped.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,@May That explains the rota breaks. The effort is real.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,@Daisuke Yes. The vendor queries are also duplicated constantly.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji If capital is frozen, we must use the software allowance.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,@Shunichi Correct. Fixed-fee work is cheaper than per-head licences.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,@All Narrow tools for one trade still run. Broad ones fail.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The misrouted deliveries trace to duplicate addresses.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,The same certificate is requested repeatedly from the same firm.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Developers are committed to accounting until Q3.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,Per-head licences climb with every department added.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,Four of six standardization efforts ended without an owner.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,We need a solution that reduces daily copying and errors.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,It must not rely on extra staff we do not have.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,It cannot depend on network coverage we do not have.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,It must fit within the recurring software allowance.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"It should be narrow and specific, not a broad platform.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
